---
/**
 * Applies the theme a visitor picked in the footer (System, Light or Dark) before the first
 * paint, so a dark-mode visitor who chose light never sees a flash. Without a choice, or when
 * storage is blocked, nothing is set and the page follows the system (src/lib/theme.ts).
 * The Caddyfile's CSP allows this exact script by its hash: any edit, even whitespace, needs
 * the new hash there (tests/csp.test.ts checks it).
 */
---

<script is:inline>
  try {
    const t = localStorage.getItem('bemmoly.site.theme');
    if (t === 'light' || t === 'dark') document.documentElement.dataset.theme = t;
  } catch {
    // Storage blocked: the page follows the system setting.
  }
</script>
